    "description": "AI control setting where agents do software-engineering main tasks inside live multi-service Linux environments while optionally pursuing hidden sabotage side tasks. Programmatic scorers check main and side success; a trusted monitor scores suspicion. Cards often report stealth success (undetected sabotage). The public Control Tower release covers 10 environments (919 main / 93 side tasks); the paper describes 20 / 1,667 / 185.",
